; HomerView.jkm -- HomerView's keys, for reference
;
; NOT WHAT BINDS THEM. JAWS loads an application key map named after the
; executable, and nothing on this machine is called HomerView.exe, so this file
; is never read. The bindings are written into the user's own default.jkm by
; chainJawsScripts, which copies the factory file first and adds to it. This
; copy is kept so the keys have one readable home in the project.
;
; SECTIONS MATTER MORE THAN KEYS HERE.
;
; [Common Keys] applies everywhere, in every application and every cursor mode.
; Only commands that must work before HomerView is running belong there, plus
; the few that are about HomerView itself rather than about a page.
;
; [Virtual Keys] applies while the VIRTUAL CURSOR is active, which for a web
; page is most of the time. It is NOT the same as "while Edge is in front": in
; the address bar or a form field these do not fire, and the key reaches the
; browser instead.
;
; Scoping a command to the BROWSER -- every cursor mode, Edge only -- needs
; more than an msedge.jkm: HomerView's scripts have to be CHAINED INTO EDGE'S
; OWN SCRIPT SET, because Edge already has JAWS scripts and a key map naming
; our commands cannot resolve them otherwise. That work is described in
; chainJawsScripts and is not done yet.

[Common Keys]
Alt+JAWSKey+A=hVCheckAccessibility
Alt+JAWSKey+C=hVFindContacts
Alt+JAWSKey+D=hVDismissDialog
Alt+JAWSKey+F10=hVShowHomerViewMenu
Alt+JAWSKey+H=hVLaunchHomerView
Alt+JAWSKey+I=hVCheckAccessibilityIbm
Alt+JAWSKey+L=hVCopyLogToClipboard
Alt+JAWSKey+Q=hVSayDiagnostics
Alt+Shift+H=hVHotKeyHelp

[Virtual Keys]
Alt+Apostrophe=hVSayClipboard
Alt+C=hVCopyAppend
Alt+Control+F1=hVOpenSessionLog
Alt+F1=hVShowAbout
Alt+F8=hVReadAll
Alt+L=hVDescribeLinkTarget
Alt+M=hVSayMetadata
Alt+N=hVListNames
Alt+Shift+Apostrophe=hVClearClipboard
Alt+Shift+F1=hVOpenQuickStart
Alt+Shift+P=hVCopyPageLinks
Alt+Shift+F=hVOpenPageFolder
Alt+Shift+W=hVDownloadFiles
Alt+R=hVRecentPages
Control+F11=hVElevateVersion
Alt+Shift+F8=hVGoToSelectionStart
Alt+F3=hVFindWordAtCursor
Alt+Shift+F3=hVFindWordAtCursorBackwards
Control+Apostrophe=hVSaveClipboard
Control+C=hVCopySelection
Control+F1=hVOpenUserGuide
Control+F3=hVFindByPattern
Control+F8=hVCopyAll
Control+O=hVOpenDocument
Control+S=hVSavePage
Control+Shift+Apostrophe=hVAppendClipboard
Control+Shift+E=hVExtractByPattern
Control+Shift+Y=hVYieldByPattern
Control+Shift+F1=hVOpenDeveloperNotes
Control+Shift+F3=hVFindByPatternBackwards
Control+Shift+F=hVFindBackwards
F3=hVFindNext
F8=hVStartSelection
Shift+F1=hVShowHistory
Shift+F3=hVFindPrevious
Shift+F4=hVSayTabNames
Shift+F8=hVCompleteSelection
Shift+F9=hVExtractMainContent
Shift+Q=hVMoveToProbableMain
